abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package containing the code, curated notebooks,
  observational and synthetic data products, inversion outputs, and
  provenance records used to reconstruct solar-flare-driven D-region
  electron-density enhancements from VLF amplitude and phase time series
  on the NAA-PLO propagation path for the 25 March 2008 event.
